      "desc": "**Kubernetes Kubelet** configuration is inspected for the `readOnlyPort` setting and whether it is set to `0` to disable the unauthenticated HTTP endpoint.",
      "title": "Kubelet read-only port is disabled (set to 0)",
      "types": [],
      "uid": "prowler-kubernetes-kubelet_disable_read_only_port-kind-demo-namespace: kube-system-kubelet-config"
